---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { BASE } from "../../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="案例"
  description="Vibe Coding 真实案例：保留问题背景、协作过程、关键迭代与验证证据。"
>
  <section class="cases-page site-shell">
    <header class="cases-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Case files</p>
      <h1>真实案例，<br /><em>从过程入场。</em></h1>
      <p>不只展示最后的代码。每个案例都会保留原始任务、Agent 协作过程、关键判断，以及可以复查的验证证据。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="case-placeholder" aria-labelledby="case-placeholder-title">
      <div class="case-number" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>CASE</span>
        <strong>01</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="case-content">
        <p class="case-status"><span></span> Published / 实践复盘</p>
        <h2 id="case-placeholder-title">一天，两个算子：用 Model Agent 复盘一场性能赛。</h2>
        <p class="case-deck">以昇腾算子挑战赛年度冠军赛的 tensorEqual 与 GeluV2 为题，把需求澄清、Ascend C 设计、精度验证和性能迭代组织成一条可复查的 Agent 工作流。</p>

        <ol aria-label="案例内容结构">
          <li>
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>赛题边界</strong>
            <small>CANN 8.5.0 / 两个算子</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>Agent 工作流</strong>
            <small>设计、实现与检查点</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>双线优化</strong>
            <small>TensorEqual / GeluV2</small>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>验证证据</strong>
            <small>精度、Profiling 与交付</small>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <a class="case-link" href={`${BASE}cases/ascend-operator-challenge/`}>
          阅读完整案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cases-page {
    padding-block: 5rem;
  }

  .cases-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .7fr 2fr 1fr;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .cases-header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 760 clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 7rem)/.94 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .cases-header h1 em {
    color: var(--red);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .cases-header > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .case-placeholder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, .65fr) 2fr;
    min-height: 520px;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 49.9%, var(--soft-line) 50%, transparent 50.1%) 0 0/32px 100%,
      rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(201,66,44,.18);
  }

  .case-number {
    display: grid;
    align-content: space-between;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .case-number span {
    font: 700 .76rem/1 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: .14em;
  }

  .case-number strong {
    color: var(--red);
    font: 760 clamp(7rem, 15vw, 13rem)/.7 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -.09em;
  }

  .case-content {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .case-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .65rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    color: var(--red-dark);
    font: 700 .76rem/1 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .case-status span {
    width: .65rem;
    height: .65rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(201,66,44,.12);
  }

  .case-content h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
    font: 730 clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.7rem)/1.02 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .case-deck {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .case-content ol {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ink);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .case-content li {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 140px;
    align-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .case-content li span,
  .case-content li small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font: .7rem/1.4 var(--mono);
  }

  .case-content li span {
    color: var(--red-dark);
  }

  .case-content li strong {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
  }

  .case-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .65rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: .25rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red);
    font: 750 .9rem/1.5 var(--mono);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .case-link span {
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    transition: transform .18s ease;
  }

  .case-link:hover span {
    transform: translate(.18rem, -.18rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .cases-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .cases-header .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .case-placeholder {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .case-number {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: end;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .case-number strong {
      font-size: 5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .cases-page {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }

    .cases-header {
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .case-placeholder {
      min-height: 0;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(201,66,44,.18);
    }

    .case-content {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .case-deck {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .case-content ol {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .case-content li {
      min-height: 125px;
    }
  }
</style>
